   "height": 81.25,
   "text": "SIGNED & IMMUTABLE: terms (the scope)\nNOT SIGNED: args \u2014 the path witness, supplied by the\nredeemer at redemption and verified on-chain hop by hop (ADR-A)\nchecked after signing: offchain hash == manager.getDelegationHash \u2713\ndelegator SA isValidSignature == 0x1626ba7e (EIP-1271) \u2713",
